#!/usr/bin/env python3
# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""
 ROV Control Station INTEGRATED V5 (PySide6) - Safe Serial1 + independent motors + RTSP camera
===============================================================
Same protocol / behaviour as before, new look:
  * smooth animated gauges, bars, sticks, attitude + compass (eased, 60 fps)
  * spinning thruster rotors with magnitude rings and sonar-style background
  * custom-painted pad buttons (vector icons, hover / press / toggle animation)
  * pulsing status pills, glowing E-STOP while armed, tab cross-fades, radar logo
  * scroll-safe layouts (nothing overlaps on small windows)
  * DS18B20 water temperature: live readout, status bar, scrolling plot, CSV column
  * Camera upgrade: embedded stream + independent camera window (same shared stream),
    settings for IP/port/profile/auth/transport, reconnection, fullscreen and snapshots.
    RTSP password and credential-bearing URL overrides are never saved in settings.
  * font auto-pick (Inter / Segoe UI Variable ... + JetBrains / Cascadia Mono ...).
    Drop any .ttf/.otf into a "fonts" folder next to this script and it is loaded.

Install:  pip install PySide6 pygame opencv-python-headless numpy vtk
Connection: Serial1 CP2102 adapter on Mega TX1=18, RX1=19.
Handshake: PING/PONG + V5 firmware identity + mode confirmation; no fake READY fallback.
Independent motor test: enable test mode, hold 1..6 to run M0..M5, release to stop; optional reverse direction.
Keyboard Space STOP/DISARM in individual mode; Esc latches emergency stop.
Safety: Firmware-authoritative ARM/DISARM, latched ESTOP / FAILSAFE, independent watchdog.
PS4 photo: ITEagle Europe / Sebastiaan Broekhoven, CC BY-SA 4.0.
Source: https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sony_DualShock_4_wireless_controller_for_PlayStation_4_(black)_-_top_view.jpg
License: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/
Original photo embedded unchanged; display crops and overlays the image.
Run:      python ROV_Control_Station_Integrated.py

Protocol (text lines, 115200 baud):
     SYS,HELLO,5 / SYS,MODE,DRIVE|INDIVIDUAL / SYS,ARM / SYS,DISARM / SYS,ESTOP / SYS,RESET
    SYS:HELLO,5,ROV_MEGA6 / SYS:MODE,DRIVE|INDIVIDUAL / SYS:STATE,ARMED|DISARMED|ESTOP|FAILSAFE
    V surge sway yaw heave roll (DRIVE only) | MT,seq,index,power (INDIVIDUAL only)
    PWM:a,b,c,d,e,f   RLY:valve,light,alert (REL: also accepted)   IMU:roll,pitch,yaw,ax,ay,az,gx,gy,gz,temp
    TMP:water_temp_C   (DS18B20, about 1 Hz)
Motor-test keyboard: hold 1..6 to run each corresponding thruster, release to stop; Space disarms all.
GUI: Sensors tab -> inner tabs 'IMU (MPU-6050)' and 'Water temp (DS18B20)'.

Camera: rtsp://user:password@169.254.23.35:554/profile1   (profile2 = sub stream, lighter)
"""
from __future__ import annotations

PS4_PHOTO_BASE64 = ''
"""Read-only controller visualizer and asynchronous STL/IMU viewer."""
